title: Game Over
role: ending
new-page: true
set-bg: img/3rd_October_2017.jpg
go-to: eg_menu
on-arrival: {!
    this.achieve('game_completed');

    if (Q.psoe_barons_revolted && !Q.psoe_sanchez_president_ever) {
      this.achieve('barones')
    }
    if (!Q.ni_un_paper_failed) {
      // TODO: Actual way for this to fail
      this.achieve("ni_un_paper");
    }
    if (!Q.not_financially_responsible){
      this.achieve("financially_responsible");
    }
    if (!Q.podemos_actually_podemos) {
      this.achieve("no_podemos");
    }

    // TODO: actual ending cards
!}

= End

@eg_menu
role: ending

- #endings
- @end_game: End game.

@rubicon
title: The Rubicon was crossed
view-if: rubicon and not end_rubicon_seen
on-arrival: end_rubicon_seen = 1
tags: endings
go-to: eg_menu
role: ending

Your actions truly marked a before and after in Catalan politics. Time slows down...

@jxcat_formed
title: Formed jxcat
view-if: jxcat_formed and not end_jxcat_seen
on-arrival: end_jxcat_seen = 1
tags: endings
go-to: eg_menu
role: ending

The jxcat electoral coalition was formed as a continuation of a national-unity list! Congrats! (this path is still wip and will make more sense once rubicon is available)

@negotiated_reform
title: The question of Constitutional Reform
view-if: negotiated_reform_trigger and not end_negotiated_reform_seen
on-arrival: end_negotiated_reform_seen = 1
tags: endings
go-to: eg_menu
role: ending

The investiture agreement has opened a constitutional reform process. What it will change, and whether it can win enough support in the Congreso and on a popular referendum, remains to be seen.

@negotiated_referendum
title: The promise of an agreed referendum
view-if: negotiated_referendum_trigger and not end_negotiated_referendum_seen
on-arrival: end_negotiated_referendum_seen = 1
tags: endings
go-to: eg_menu
role: ending

To reach the Gobierno, the current [+ spanish_coalition_disp +] has secured the votes of pro-independence parties, who have demanded an agreement where Catalonia would get the legal powers and recognition to hold a referendum on independence. It is yet to be seen if such a promise can be delivered and, even if that is the case, if it can survive both the Congreso and the Constitutional Court. Yet hope is on the horizon...

@not_possible_parlament_stuck
title: Separated twins
subtitle: You managed something I did not think even possible
view-if: not_possible_parlament_stuck and not end_not_possible_parlament_stuck
on-arrival: end_not_possible_parlament_stuck = 1
tags: endings
go-to: eg_menu
role: ending

Truly, how did you manage to approve the Law on the Referendum but NOT the one on transition? Please drop a message on reddit, discord, or raise a GitHub issue. You deserve a medal nonetheless!

# TBD: wish-making allowed here too?

@denmark_of_the_south
title: The "Denmark of the South"
view-if: parlament_climate_change_passed and parlament_inheritance_tax_passed and education_spending >= 2 and healthcare_spending >= 2 and public_salary_level >= 2 and not end_denmark_of_the_south
on-arrival: end_denmark_of_the_south = 1
tags: endings
go-to: eg_menu
role: ending

Public services and the social safety net have been widely expanded in Catalonia, supported by heavy yet progressive taxes.

@end_temp
title: WIP ending cards
view-if: not end_temp_seen
on-arrival: end_temp_seen = 1
tags: endings
go-to: eg_menu
role: ending

Thanks for playing around! Ending cards are wip!

